  "description": "Pure C# SVG reader for .NET that resolves a document into a SharpAstro.Vector scene (paths, fills, strokes, transforms, opacity groups) and leaves drawing to the caller: no rasteriser, no font code, not a pixel decoder. Written from the W3C SVG specifications. This release reads paths, basic shapes, transforms, the viewBox, solid paints and stroke properties, and reports everything it does not read.",
